{
  "name": "lake-kids",
  "about": "The owner's real session (2026-10-22): a baby by a lake with 'other animals', a kids comic, single page. The director must understand out loud, cast the animals (ducklings, frog, bunny) as first-class cast, never reply with empty text, and 'generate all pages' on the drawn page must cost $0.",
  "doc": "empty",
